('curated_giovanni_s_room','Giovanni’s Room','James Baldwin','["Narrativa contemporánea"]','1956','es','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/title/Giovanni%E2%80%99s%20Room-M.jpg','open_library','curated_giovanni_s_room'),
